FAECO — third-party notices
=========================

This file states where the project's external inputs come from and what each
upstream requires.  It does NOT license the FAECO repository itself: no
top-level LICENSE has been chosen yet, so the repository must not be
described as a "publicly redistributable project" until that is settled
(registered as an open issue in project_docs/OPEN_ISSUES.md).

Every input below was acquired at a pinned revision, and the machine-readable
record -- upstream URL, commit, SPDX licence and the per-file SHA-256 -- is
in data/raw/benchmarks/source_manifests/.

