NOT redistributed here
---------------------
The upstream benchmark files and the cell libraries themselves are NOT
distributed in this repository (see .gitignore: "experiments/2026*/" and
"data/raw/*").  What is redistributed is the project's own derived artefacts:
mapped netlists, physical labels, decision-level readings and the analysis
scripts.  The licences above govern the upstream inputs; the derived
artefacts inherit the obligations of the inputs they were made from, which
is why this notice exists.
